{
  "name": "mash-ai-text-diector-and-humaniser",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "One agent skill that runs the academic writing audit chain: live AI pattern detection against the Wikipedia signs of AI writing page, humanising, similarity measurement and reduction, and a proof run",
